      "scope": "followup",
      "finding": "Deep binding JSON can raise an exception outside the initial catch list",
      "resolution": "The narrow binding-assessment boundary catches Exception and fails closed with the original base result retained. RecursionError and AttributeError cases are tested; interruptions derived from BaseException still propagate. The suggested malformed audit-user trigger would already fail earlier base parsing, not this new boundary."
    },
