      "scope": "followup",
      "finding": "Missing uncommitted-tail keys could fail after binding success",
      "resolution": "The production episode_records loader always supplies both keys; the proposed missing-key path cannot arise through it. The empty-attempt exception was nevertheless tightened to require an explicit integer zero byte count, with a missing-metadata negative test."
    },
    {
      "scope": "self-review",
      "finding": "Scheduled kill may precede the episode pin write",
      "resolution": "Only an empty, unclaimed attempt with no committed or partial tool bytes and no operation bindings may lack its pin. No operation can use this exception."
    },
    {
      "scope": "self-review",
      "finding": "Episode pin dictionary equality tolerates bool/int equivalence",
